      "description": "Passed priority during combat without casting Douse in Gloom on Thaumaturge's Familiar (1/3), which would have dealt 2 damage to it. Combined with the 1 combat damage from the blocked Thopter, this would have killed the Familiar (total 3 damage = its toughness). Instead, the Thopter dies and the Familiar survives as a flyer that can block future Thopter attacks.",
