      "better_line": "Cast Douse in Gloom targeting Thaumaturge's Familiar for 2 damage before combat damage resolves. The 1 combat damage from the Thopter plus 2 from Douse kills the Familiar, clearing the way for future Thopter attacks and gaining 2 life. Both creatures trade instead of just losing the Thopter.",
