      "decision_index": 132,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Cast Malefic Scythe during combat instead of using Douse in Gloom to kill Thaumaturge's Familiar. The Thopter token is blocked by the 1/3 Familiar, and Douse in Gloom dealing 2 damage combined with the Thopter's 1 combat damage would exactly kill the Familiar (3 total damage to 3 toughness), saving the Thopter token and gaining 2 life. Instead, the Scythe does nothing in combat and the Thopter trades unfavorably into the Familiar.",
