    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "At end of their own turn with 3 untapped mana that will go to waste, Gem31P passed instead of casting Artificer's Epiphany. They control multiple artifacts (Malefic Scythe, Planar Atlas, 2 Thopter tokens), so Epiphany would draw 2 cards with no discard. This mana cannot be used for anything else as the turn is ending.",
