    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Declined to cast Douse in Gloom on the attacking Thaumaturge's Familiar (1/3 flyer). Killing it during combat would save 1 damage and gain 2 life (net 3 life swing), and the 1/3 flyer is arguably one of the best targets Douse in Gloom will find since it can't kill the bigger threats like Filigree Attendant (5/3) or Drownyard Explorers (2/4).",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority, taking 3 damage from both attackers (going to 12 life).",
