    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "At 12 life facing 7 damage from attackers (including two flyers), passing on Douse in Gloom means taking significantly more damage. Killing Thaumaturge's Familiar with Douse (2 damage kills it, gain 2 life) would be a 3-life swing (prevent 1 + gain 2), going to 8 instead of 5 after blocks. At low life totals against a board with flyers, this matters.",
