    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Gem31P is at 5 life facing 7 damage (Filigree Attendant 4/3 flying + Thaumaturge's Familiar 1/3 flying + Drownyard Explorers 2/4). By casting Douse in Gloom on any creature to gain 2 life (going to 7), then blocking Thaumaturge's Familiar with the untapped Thopter Token (reducing flying damage by 1), total damage becomes 6 vs 7 life — surviving at 1. Without Douse in Gloom, the incoming 7 damage is lethal.",
