    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem31P Hype let Tezzeret, Artifice Master resolve without first casting Phyrexian Reclamation for {B} with their one available mana. By not casting Reclamation before Tezzeret resolves, they risk having it exiled from hand by Tezzeret's +4 ability. There's no reason to hold Reclamation since it's a permanent they want on the battlefield anyway, and casting it now protects it from hand disruption.",
